# The sandbox at its default size with rigid bodies. Once the sand and the
# water have fallen, it drops wooden boxes onto the sand heap, into the
# water on the right ledge (they sink: there is no buoyancy yet), onto the
# floor, and one onto another. Then it digs the sand out from under the
# first box, which falls into the hole, and tries to drop a box into the
# stone floor, which the tool refuses. The water a box pushes away waits in
# the queue until the box moves on.
